msgid "👋 Introduction"
msgstr ""

#. content.xml (slide 'page1')
msgid ""
"<1>Collabora Office </1><2>presentation</2><3> is a </3><4>tool</4><5> that "
"lets you create, edit, and deliver presentations in a simple way. You can "
"work alone on a document, or collaboratively as part of a team. This "
"introduction template will help you get started and explore some of the main"
" features of the product.</5>"
msgstr ""

